    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d824">

                <pb facs="0555" n="1673" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v15p2/pg1673"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">795.00/12–2353</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of Defense (Wilson) to the Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1953-12-23">December 23, 1953</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Foster</hi>: Attached is a copy of a memorandum from the Joint
                    Chiefs of Staff which contains the statement of the initial military objectives
                    and the major courses of action which they recommend be undertaken in the event
                    that hostilities in Korea are renewed by the Communists in the near future. The
                    Joint Chiefs of Staff have taken into account in this statement the discussion
                    of the National Security Council on this subject at the 3 December
                        meeting.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d824-f1"/></p>
                <p>As you know, this subject is scheduled for presentation to the National Security
                    Council again on Thursday, 7 January 1954. I hope that you can examine the views
                    of the Joint Chiefs of Staff and that your representatives can meet with
                    representatives of the Joint Chiefs of Staff and the Assistant Secretary of
                    Defense for International Security Affairs on this subject at an early date so
                    that we may present to the Security Council a coordinated paper.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">C. E.
                                Wilson</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d824-a1.xml" xpointer="d824-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d824-f1" n="1" xml:id="d824-f1-content">
                <p>For a report on that meeting, see the memorandum of discussion at the 173d
                    meeting, <ref target="#pg1636">p. 1636</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
